From b68f02f8f2ac066a4b1e1e2ec39e906f5a35fe8e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hubert Behaghel <behaghel@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 16:01:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Merge heading and status fidelity into block separator fix

Combine the reviewed heading/status modules with the existing separator fix without changing their public contracts. Resolve the test relocation conflict by retaining the separator regressions here and the heading regressions in their dedicated module. Source-only adapter lifecycle: 102 pass, 25 live skipped. SDK: 651/655 pass; identical four baseline failures reproduced on the 653-test status parent. Four modules and both spacing functions compile strictly.

